# terraform — state and account-specific config stay local; the provider lock
# file (.terraform.lock.hcl) IS committed for reproducible provider versions.
# terraform.tfvars IS committed too: the only account-specific value is the
# account ID, which lives in *.auto.tfvars (auto-loaded) and in backend.hcl
# (a backend block cannot reference variables, so the ARN is literal there).
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
*.auto.tfvars
backend.hcl
tfplan
terraform-outputs.json
